==================================================
DSV — DARK STARVE VALLEY
==================================================

GENRE:
Stylized 3D Dark Fantasy Farming RPG, Unreal Engine, PC.

CORE:
Farming · Alchemy · Relationships · Choice · Consequence · Combat
Future: asymmetric co-op / NPC Possession.

HIGH CONCEPT:
- Player is infected with the same disease as NPCs.
- Serum is scarce.
- Prototype dilemma:
  6 seeds → 6 crops → max 2 serum → 3 candidates (Player + NPC A + NPC B) → only 2 saved.
- Unsaved character becomes Boss.
- Choice has relationship + gameplay + narrative consequences.

GAMEPLAY LOOP:
Explore → Gather → Farm → Alchemy → Interact → Choose → Relationship → Consequence → Combat/Romance/Story → Ending.

PROTOTYPE:
Single-player proof of gameplay loop.
Architecture should support future:
Character, NPC State, Quest, Relationship, Combat, Boss, Dialogue, World State, Player Choice, Possession.

FUTURE CHARACTER MODEL:
Character = Identity + State + Role + Abilities + Relationships + Agency

Important:
- Character is fundamentally one architecture.
- Player/NPC/Boss are not necessarily separate character classes.
- Boss = state/form/transformation of the same Character.
- Possession = change of controller/agency, not conversion into PlayerCharacter.
- Character can be controlled by AI or Player depending on agency/controller.
- Current CharacterMaster is player-first; NPC implementation comes later.

Example:
CharacterMaster
 └─ Identity / ID
     ├─ Logic
     ├─ State
     ├─ Behavior
     ├─ Animation
     ├─ Character-specific Input
     └─ Character-specific handling

==================================================
M4 / PROTOTYPE DEFINITION OF DONE
==================================================

1. Player becomes infected.
2. Meets 2 infected NPCs.
3. Disease progresses.
4. Plants 6 seeds.
5. Crafts 2 serum.
6. Chooses 2 of 3 characters.
7. Relationship/consequence occurs.
8. Unsaved character becomes Boss.
9. Combat.
10. Ending.
11. Checkpoint/reload.
12. Alternate route only through New Game.

M4 GATE:
Player must understand:
- infected state
- 2 serum
- 3 candidates
- meaningful discomfort/regret
- desire to see alternative outcome

If M4 fails, stop expansion and fix core.

SAVE:
- No manual save.
- No multiple slots.
- No branch saves.
- Only latest checkpoint.
- Alternate branch requires New Game.

