CURRENT INVENTORY / UI SCOPE
==================================================

Do NOT build a general inventory system for M4.

Inventory only needs:
1. Planting → open inventory → select seed → confirm/cancel.
2. Alchemy/serum → open inventory → select required item → confirm/cancel.
3. NPC interaction → open relevant dialogue/character UI.

No need now:
- Move
- Store
- Drop
- Sort
- Weight
- Capacity
- Stack management
- General-purpose item action framework

If item is seed but player is not at FarmPlot:
→ reject/disable Plant action.

